y still exit 0** (Rule A too narrow), not a live Rule B false positive.\n- Did not read T-058 (independent dual track).\n\n## Open questions\n\n- Dead-reckoning threshold N (TH-0010); whether review verdicts should map into protocol feedback; structured state vs narrative dual-track.\n\n## Verdict\n\n**PASS**\n\n## Next recommendation\n\nCross with T-058 on **intersection-only** P0s; if product wants “more autonomous continue,” prioritize structured state + closeout consistency + TH-0010 guard before richer next-action generation.",
