docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:28:   "verdict_reason": "逐条复核全部属实：(1) plugins/harnessloop/skills/harnessloop-loop/SKILL.md:57 Core Contract 为 'real data, dynamic data, repository source, or source-data files'（无 runtime），:436-443 Verification Phase 清单同样只有 static/dynamic/source/source-data 四项；(2) 同文件 :3 frontmatter 写 'static/dynamic/runtime/source'，:328-341 Round Structure 含 evidence/runtime/ 目录，自相矛盾；(3) references/evidence-index-template.md:32-38、references/eval-matrix-template.md:11、harnessloop-evidence/SKILL.md:19 均为含 human-confirmation 的 5 类；(4) README.md:158-163 只列 4 类；(5) docs/usage.md 与 docs/harnessloop-framework.md 的验证清单均含 runtime；(6) 全仓 grep 确认 human-confirmation 证据在 rounds/NNNN/evidence/{static,dynamic,runtime,source}/ 及所有模板（decision/control-contract/adversarial-review）中均无落盘位置说明；(7) verify_protocol.py 只做 scope-lock 包含与引用存在性检查，validate.py 文档一致性阶段只对 init_project.py 骨架断言，枚举无机械校验，建议可行。severity 由 high 降为 medium：同一 SKILL 文件内 frontmatter、round 结构、自审信号（:315 'Add missing runtime validation'、:447 'missing runtime coverage'）多处提及 runtime，agent 完全遗漏 runtime 验证的实际风险被缓解；human-confirmation 落盘缺口影响小；无安全/数据后果，属真实但中等的协议枚举漂移。",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:54:   "evidence": "新增漂移实测：evals/matrix.md 10 维 vs eval-matrix-template 13 维（缺 Blocker type、Acceptance risk、Evidence quality，列结构也从 5 列变 2 列）；state/self-check.md 7 字段 vs 模板 12（缺 Self-audit present、Data/tool access described、Local channel parameter store protected、Intake gate required、Last checked）；meta/self-audit.md Loop Health 7/8 行（缺 Recoverable blocker stalled）、Deterministic Signals 11/12 行（缺 Recoverable blocker next action）、Local Repair Decision 缺 Blocker type/Recovery eligible；state/current.md 缺 Imported intake path（该 mock 恰演示 intake 流程）且 'Next action safety: local-write' 不在模板枚举 read-only|write|external-trigger|human-decision|unknown 中（decision.md 同）；scope-lock.md 缺 One-Variable Strict Mode/Runtime Recovery Limits/Human Confirmation Required 三节；round-summary.md 纯散文，缺 ## Cost 与 ## Blocker Classification；decision.md 缺 Action type 枚举与 Evidence Cited 表；reviews/adversarial-review.md 缺 Review Scope/7 行 Checks 表/Required Next Action；goal.md 缺 Acceptance Criteria/Source Of Truth；setup/data-sources.md 缺 Local Channel Parameters/Secret Handling 两节；setup/cost-context-policy.md 缺 Execution Delegation Matrix/Handoff Budget Rules。",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:60:   "verdict_reason": "逐条比对全部复现。新增 12 处漂移属实：evals/matrix.md 10 维/2 列 vs eval-matrix-template.md 13 维/5 列（缺 Blocker type、Acceptance risk、Evidence quality）；state/self-check.md 7 字段 vs 模板 12（缺 Self-audit present、Data/tool access described、Local channel parameter store protected、Intake gate required、Last checked）；meta/self-audit.md Loop Health 7/8 行、Deterministic Signals 11/12 行、Local Repair Decision 缺 Blocker type/Recovery eligible；state/current.md 缺 Imported intake path 且第 11 行 'Next action safety: local-write' 不在 current-state-template.md:14 的枚举 read-only|write|external-trigger|human-decision|unknown 中（decision.md:9 同）；scope-lock.md 缺 One-Variable Strict Mode/Runtime Recovery Limits/Human Confirmation Required；round-summary.md 纯散文无 ## Cost 与 ## Blocker Classification；decision.md 无 Action type 枚举与 Evidence Cited 表；adversarial-review.md 无 Review Scope/Checks 表/Required Next Action；goal.md 无 Acceptance Criteria/Source Of Truth；data-sources.md 无 Local Channel Parameters/Secret Handling；cost-context-policy.md 无 Execution Delegation Matrix/Handoff Budget Rules。已知 3 处（control-contract 4/7 blocker 类型、intake-gate 10/11 项、evidence-index 13/14 列）复核属实。validate.py 主张属实：scripts/validate.py:205-228 的文档一致性阶段只用 init_project.py 的骨架文件名做包含匹配，verify_protocol.py 只查 dangling citation 与 scope-lock Allowed Changes，无任何 mock-vs-template 结构断言。README.md:246 确将 mock-project 定位为 'artificial reference project'。severity 校准为 medium：examples/ 在 plugins/harnessloop 之外、不随插件安装分发，运行中的 agent 按 SKILL 使用 references/ 下正确模板生成文件，漂移只误导浏览仓库的读者，无运行时破坏，validate 仍通过；系统性漂移+非法枚举+缺防护值得修（建议本身可行），但影响面不足以支撑 high。",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:69:   "claim": "P0-5 交付的机械协议门（scope-lock 越界 + 悬空引用检查）只被仓库自身的 validate.py 用来测 mock-project；12 个 SKILL.md、27 个模板、agents yaml 中没有任何一处指示 agent 在轮次验收或 continue 门中运行它。安装到真实项目后该门为纯死代码，而 cost-model.md 却把 'verify_protocol.py flags a scope violation' 算作项目运行期的 payout/拦截事件——文档承诺与实际接线矛盾。",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:92:   "verdict_reason": "全部关键断言逐条核实并部分实机复现。(1) harnessloop-secrets/SKILL.md:55-60 六条命令确为仓库根相对路径 'python plugins/harnessloop/skills/harnessloop-secrets/scripts/channel_params.py ...'；检查本机实际安装缓存 ~/.claude/plugins/cache/harnessloop/harnessloop/0.10.0/skills/... 证实安装树中不存在 'plugins/harnessloop/' 前缀，且技能执行 cwd 为目标项目，故该路径在安装后双重不可解析。(2) harnessloop-loop/SKILL.md:485 与 references/round-summary-template.md:27 确用裸路径 'scripts/round_cost.py'；init_project.py 无任何脚本拷贝逻辑，目标项目只生成 .harnessloop/ markdown 骨架，裸路径必失败。(3) 正确占位符写法确实并存于 loop SKILL.md:103/109 (<skill-dir>)、harnessloop-init/SKILL.md:42/48 (<plugin-root>)、docs/cost-model.md:51 (<plugin>)，写法不一致成立。(4) round_cost.py:43-45 默认只读 ~/.claude/projects/<escaped-path>/，我用安装缓存中的脚本对无转录项目实跑，输出 'Transcript directory not found' 并 exit=2，复现了 Codex-only 环境每轮 exit 2；.codex-plugin/plugin.json、install-codex.sh、mock-project environment.md:3 'Detected environment: codex' 证实双端发布。减轻情节：SKILL.md:485 同句已有兜底（exit 非零则记 cost unavailable），Codex 下协议不断裂只是 cost 功能恒不可用；且 SKILL 由 LLM 阅读，强模型可自行纠偏——但这正破坏 Deterministic Manager 的确定性目的。medium 定级恰当，维持不变。",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:224:   "title": "verify_protocol 对 scope-lock 里的 glob 通配符按字面比较，合规文件被误报 scope-lock-violation",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:229:   "claim": "extract_allowed_spans 会把 `evidence/*.md` 这类 span 原样收进 allowed 列表，而 is_under（:44-46）只做规整后的字面前缀比较——含 * 的 span 永远匹配不到任何真实文件，等效于该条允许项被静默作废，落在其下的合规文件全部误报 scope-lock-violation、轮次 exit 1。Agent/用户在 Allowed Changes 表里写 glob 是极自然的写法，且既无解析报错也无跳过提示。",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:230:   "evidence": "fixture 复现（scratchpad/fx6）：scope-lock Allowed Changes 为 '- May write matching evidence files: `evidence/*.md`'，仅有的文件 evidence/note.md 完全符合意图 → 输出 ['scope-lock-violation']，EXIT=1。作者复评仅认领'表格列序假设'（round-2 note ①）与无反引号 fail-safe，未覆盖通配符。",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:231:   "suggestion": "在 allowed 判定中对含 */? 的 span 走 fnmatch/pathlib.match 分支（对 norm 后的相对路径匹配）；或最小改动：检测到含通配符的 span 时报专门的 'unsupported-glob-in-scope-lock' violation，把静默作废变成显式报错。",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:236:   "verdict_reason": "亲自复现：在 scratchpad 构造 fixture（scope-lock Allowed Changes 为 `evidence/*.md`，唯一文件 evidence/note.md 完全符合意图），运行 verify_protocol.py 输出 scope-lock-violation、EXIT=1；把 span 改为 `evidence/` 则 EXIT=0。源码证实机制：extract_allowed_spans（:49-77）原样收集含 * 的 span，:139 的 allowed 判定走 is_under（:44-46）的 normpath+startswith 字面前缀比较，全文件无 fnmatch/Path.match，含通配符的 span 永远匹配不到任何真实文件，且错误信息（\"outside every allowed path\"）不提示 glob 被字面比较。但 severity 虚高：失败方向是 fail-closed（误拦合规轮次而非错误放行）、workaround 是一行 scope-lock 改写、仓库唯一示例（examples/mock-project/.../rounds/0001/scope-lock.md）用的是目录前缀写法不触发此问题、SKILL.md :428 仅禁止委派而非要求人工确认 scope-lock 修改（agent 可一轮内自愈）。剩余危害是误导性诊断加一次浪费的 gate 循环，应降为 low。",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:240:   "title": "verify_protocol 遇非 UTF-8 的 scope-lock/review 文件直接裸 UnicodeDecodeError traceback，--json 消费者拿不到结构化输出",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:252:   "verdict_reason": "亲自复现两条路径均成立。(1) verify_protocol.py:156 `review.read_text(encoding=\"utf-8\")`：在 scratchpad fixture 的 reviews/r.md 写入 latin-1 字节 0xe9，运行 `--json` → 裸 traceback \"UnicodeDecodeError: 'utf-8' codec can't decode byte 0xe9 in position 3\"，EXIT=1；(2) verify_protocol.py:128 `scope_lock.read_text(encoding=\"utf-8\")`：scope-lock.md 含 0xe9 同样崩溃，且实测 --json 模式 stdout 为 0 字节，JSON 消费方无任何结构化输出可解析。main() (:180-202) 无任何 try/except，两处 read_text 均无 errors 参数。对比证据也属实：round_cost.py:85 确用 errors=\"replace\"。severity=low 校准准确：exit 1 仍 fail-closed（不会误判通过），危害仅限 --json 契约破坏与错误定位困难，且触发需要 round 目录混入非 UTF-8 文件（该目录文件通常由 agent 以 UTF-8 生成），概率不高。建议的修复（errors='replace' 或转为 unreadable-file violation）合理且 effort S。",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:288:   "title": "m7 复测仍在：scope-lock 对 rounds/ 之外的写入（含真实源码）完全不可见，可用 git 低成本机械化",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:293:   "claim": "Rule A 的 checked_files 只收集 round_dir/evidence 与 round_dir/reviews 下的文件（verify_protocol.py:110-115），scope-lock 明写『Disallowed: Source code changes』时，向项目 src/ 或 round 根目录写任意文件均不产生 violation；且某轮不写 evidence/reviews 时畸形/缺失 scope-lock 也不报（:117-118 的检查以 checked_files 非空为前提）。而 scope-lock 一词在协议语境里恰是约束代码改动边界的核心机制。",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:294:   "evidence": "复现（scratchpad fixture，已清理）：scope-lock 仅允许 rounds/0001/{evidence,reviews,handoffs}/，写入 <project>/src/hijacked.py 与 round 根 SNEAKY.md → verify 输出『All mechanical protocol gates passed』EXIT=0。作者 adversarial-review-p0.md m7/第二轮复检均承认未修（『维持原判，属 P1 扩面项』），0.10.0 代码逐行核实无变化。",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:300:   "verdict_reason": "亲自复现成立：在 scratchpad 构造 fixture（scope-lock 仅允许 rounds/0001/{evidence,reviews,handoffs}/ 且明写 Disallowed: Source code changes），写入 <project>/src/hijacked.py 与 round 根 SNEAKY.md，另建 0002 轮（无 evidence/reviews + 畸形 scope-lock）→ verify_protocol.py 输出 'All mechanical protocol gates passed'，EXIT=0。代码证据吻合：verify_protocol.py:110-115 的 checked_files 只 rglob round_dir/evidence 与 round_dir/reviews；:118 的 `if checked_files:` 使无 evidence/reviews 时缺失/畸形 scope-lock 全部静默跳过；全文件无任何对 round 根、state/、项目源码的检查。作者自证：adversarial-review-p0.md:164 原述 m7，:242 第二轮复检'未声称修复…维持原判，属 P1 扩面项'；git log 显示该文件自引入（d374293）后零改动，版本 0.10.0（package.json/plugin.json 一致）。发现中的文件路径多写了一层 plugins/harnessloop/，实际为 plugins/harnessloop/skills/harnessloop-loop/scripts/verify_protocol.py，行号无误。severity 校准为 medium 而非 high：脚本 docstring（:5-11）明文声明 Rule A 仅覆盖 evidence/reviews（属已文档化的 mechanical subset 限制而非隐性契约违背）；作者已知情并规划扩面（P1-6，不阻塞）；该工具是协作型 agent 的漂移检测器而非安全边界（越界 agent 同样可以不跑 verify 或改写 scope-lock.md）。但'All mechanical protocol gates passed'对公然越界轮次给出假保证是真实风险，git-diff 扩面建议合理且低成本，故不降为 low。",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:310:   "evidence": "复现：decision.md 写 `- Feedback: succeeded!!` 与 `- Accepted: maybe` → verify EXIT=0。示例漂移：examples/mock-project/.../rounds/0001/decision.md:9 与 state/current.md:11 均为 `Next action safety: local-write`，而 current-state-template.md:14 的枚举是 `read-only | write | external-trigger | human-decision | unknown`，decision-template.md 的 Next Action 节要求 `Action type: next-subgoal | investigation | ...`，mock 两者皆无。",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:348:   "verdict_reason": "亲自复现 + 原文确认。(1) verify_protocol.py（plugins/harnessloop/skills/harnessloop-loop/scripts/）全文只有 Rule A（scope-lock 包含）与 Rule B（review 引用存在性），从不读取 state/evidence-index.md；scripts/validate.py 亦不查（grep 'evidence-index' 仅命中 init_project.py:32 的模板拷贝）。(2) fixture 复现：索引写入指向不存在 GHOST.md 的行且 Artifact health=valid，真实 evidence/runtime/test-output.md 不入索引，verify_protocol.py 输出 'All mechanical protocol gates passed.'，EXIT=0。(3) 列漂移程序化比对：模板表头 14 列、mock 13 列，差集恰为 'Channel parameter references'，该列全仓库仅出现在模板一处；init_project.py 会把 14 列模板灌入新项目 state/evidence-index.md，与 mock 示例实际不一致，且无任何表头校验。SKILL.md:287-289 原文确认索引承载 path/health/freshness 契约，harnessloop-continue/evidence SKILL 以其为准。细微修正：SKILL.md:289 散文列出的 13 字段与 mock 一致而与模板不一致，修法可能是删模板多余列而非补 mock；发现的 file 路径写重了一层（实际为 plugins/harnessloop/skills/.../evidence-index-template.md）；verify_protocol.py 文档声明只做机械规则、判断留给模型，故该缺口部分属设计边界——但 Path 存在性与 health=valid 一致性与既有 Rule B 同属机械可查，建议成立。severity=medium 校准无虚高：命中框架核心承诺但上层仍有模型判断门，无安全影响。",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:352:   "title": "round 完结所需文件/章节无机械校验，shipped mock 自己就缺 ## Cost 且 scope-lock 节名偏离模板",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:357:   "claim": "SKILL.md:328-341 规定 round 目录 8 个成员，:485 强制 round-summary.md 必含 `## Cost` 节（round_cost.py 输出粘贴处）；机器全不检查。且作为唯一实例参考的 mock-project 本身即漂移：round-summary.md 无任何模板章节（无 ## Cost/## Evidence Produced/## Blocker Classification），scope-lock.md 用 `## Objective`/`## Verification` 而模板是 `## Round Objective`/`## Verification Commands Or Checks`——validate 阶段 5 对 mock 全绿，等于框架 CI 为漂移示例背书，实战中模型将模仿示例而非模板。",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:358:   "evidence": "原文对照：SKILL.md:485『Update round-summary.md, including its ## Cost section』vs examples/.../rounds/0001/round-summary.md 全文 6 行纯散文、grep '## Cost' 零命中。fixture 复现：round 只有 decision.md 无 round-summary.md → verify EXIT=0。scope-lock 节名：examples/.../scope-lock.md:3 `## Objective` vs scope-lock-template.md `## Round Objective`。",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:359:   "suggestion": "新增 Rule F（约 20 行）：decision.md 存在（round 已完结）时要求 scope-lock.md 与 round-summary.md 存在，round-summary 必含 `## Cost`，scope-lock 必含 `## Disallowed Changes` 与 `## Rollback Condition` 标题；同时把 mock-project 的 round-summary/scope-lock 修到模板格式，让 validate 阶段 5 变成这条规则的正向 fixture。",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:364:   "verdict_reason": "全部关键主张亲自复现：(1) SKILL.md:485 原文即『Update round-summary.md, including its ## Cost section』，:328-341 确有 round 目录模板；(2) verify_protocol.py 仅实现 Rule A（scope-lock 包含）与 Rule B（引用存在），对 round-summary.md 存在性、## Cost 节、scope-lock 节名无任何检查（docstring 自述只查 machine-checkable 规则，而文件存在/必含标题恰属 machine-checkable，故非有意排除的 judgment gate）；(3) mock round-summary.md 全文 7 行纯散文，grep '## Cost' 零命中，无任何 round-summary-template.md 章节；(4) mock scope-lock.md:3 为 ## Objective、:19 为 ## Verification，而 scope-lock-template.md 为 ## Round Objective / ## Verification Commands Or Checks，且缺 ## One-Variable Strict Mode 与 ## Runtime Recovery Limits；(5) 运行 verify_protocol.py --project examples/mock-project → EXIT=0 全绿；在 scratchpad 构造只含 decision.md 的 round fixture → EXIT=0 零违规，复现『round 完结无机械校验』；(6) validate.py:237-241 阶段 5 确以 mock 零违规为通过条件，即 CI 为漂移示例背书（讽刺的是 validate.py:319 阶段 6 反而机械断言 round_cost.py 输出含 ## Cost）。发现的小瑕疵：file 字段路径多了 plugins/harnessloop/ 前缀（实际在仓库根 examples/ 下），『8 个成员』按顶层数是 7，均不影响实质。severity=medium 校准合理：无运行时/安全影响，但对以机械强制为卖点的框架，唯一参考实例违反自身显式 must 且被自家 CI 背书，属真实协议缺陷，修复成本小。",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:380:   "verdict_reason": "技术事实亲自复现成立，但 severity 虚高。复现：在 scratchpad 构造 fixture（.harnessloop/goals/g1/rounds/r1/，scope-lock 合规，review 引用 `docs.python.org/3/library/os.html` 与 `github.com/org/repo/blob/main/src/foo.py`），运行 plugins/harnessloop/skills/harnessloop-loop/scripts/verify_protocol.py --project → 恰好 2 条 dangling-citation、EXIT=1；带 `https://` 前缀的同一 URL 被 :91 的 `\"://\" in cleaned` 正确豁免。代码路径与发现描述一致：:98-101 对「含 / 且尾段有扩展名」的 span 一律做存在性硬校验，无裸域名豁免。版本匹配（plugin.json 0.10.0）。nm11 确已在 adversarial-review-p0.md:217/:239 被作者认领为 minor，且其「shipped 仓库零误报」理由亦经我验证属实（verify_protocol.py 对 examples/mock-project EXIT=0）。severity 校准为 low 的依据：(1) verify_protocol.py 当前未接入任何运行时门——grep 全部 skills（含 harnessloop-continue、harnessloop-loop SKILL.md 及 references/）无一处引用该脚本，仅 scripts/validate.py（仓库自身 CI）在 mock-project/fixture 上调用；(2) 发现自述的危害是条件式的（「一旦按发现 1 把 verify 接入 continuation gate」），今日实际触发面仅限用户手动对真实项目跑脚本且引用了无协议前缀的裸域名+扩展名 URL；(3) 作者已记录并有意推迟（nm11 minor，随 m7/n9 收口），故本发现属「复测确认已知缺陷仍在」而非新暴露的执行面漏洞。缺陷真实、修复代价 S，但在被接入门禁之前为潜伏性误报，medium 高估。",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:396:   "verdict_reason": "全部关键事实亲自复现/确认：(1) SKILL.md:293 原文含 \"must be updated ... after negative or neutral feedback, and before classifying a goal as blocked\"（发现中文件路径有重复段笔误，实际为 plugins/harnessloop/skills/harnessloop-loop/SKILL.md，内容一致），SKILL.md:473 重申同一要求；(2) self-audit-template.md:30-45 的 Deterministic Signals 表确列 \"Repeated next action count / max 2 identical actions\" 与 \"Stale evidence count / 0 for acceptance\"，默认全 unknown、由模型手填、无任何校验；(3) verify_protocol.py 通读确认仅实现 Rule A（scope-lock 包含）与 Rule B（citation 存在），全仓库 grep 无任何代码校验 self-audit 触发或计算上述信号（init_project.py:34 仅拷贝模板）；(4) fixture 复现成功：负反馈 decision.md + 全项目无 meta/self-audit.md → verify_protocol.py --json 输出 violations:[] 且 EXIT=0。脚本 docstring 虽自限 \"mechanical subset\"，但发现的论点正是这些规则按脚本自身 \"machine-checkable\" 标准即属机械子集却未纳入——SKILL 用 \"must\" 声明、模板自称 deterministic，故属真实 enforcement gap 而非品味问题；SKILL.md:485 round_cost.py 的粘贴模式先例也属实，建议可行。severity=medium 校准恰当：非代码正确性缺陷、需模型不合规才触发危害，但被架空的是框架核心防死循环机制且修复有界。",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:412:   "verdict_reason": "亲自复现成立。(1) SKILL.md:355-368 确实规定 handoff 命名 `<round>-<seq>-<role>-<task-slug>-<status>.md`（示例 status 仅 open/closed），:379 规定 closed handoff 须归档到 archive/；:308『Handoff stagnation』与 :322『open handoff age』自审信号依赖该命名。(2) verify_protocol.py 只实现 Rule A（scope-lock 包含性，仅扫 evidence/ 与 reviews/）和 Rule B（review 引用存在性），全仓库 grep 'handoff' 在任何脚本中零命中——无任何机器校验。(3) 在 scratchpad 构造 fixture：rounds/0001/handoffs/notes.md（完全不符合命名）+ decision.md 已存在但 handoffs/ 残留 0001-01-review-adversarial-closed.md 未归档 → verify_protocol.py 输出 'All mechanical protocol gates passed'，EXIT=0，两类违规均静默通过。(4) mock 项目 archive/0001-01-review-adversarial-closed.md 符合规范，证实作者意图仅靠示例传达。severity=low 恰当：verify 脚本自述只做 machine-checkable 子集，命名正则正属此类，补 Rule H 与设计一致；后果是停滞类信号可审计性下降而非行为错误。小瑕疵：finding 的 file 字段路径前缀重复（实际为 plugins/harnessloop/skills/harnessloop-loop/SKILL.md），行号准确。",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:422:   "evidence": "证据链：(1) SKILL.md:473 'If negative or neutral feedback repeats without new evidence... update meta/self-audit.md before starting another execution round'——后果仅为写文件；(2) SKILL.md:179 self-audit fail 仍可继续，只要 next action 'repairs the audit failure, creates an explicit human-confirmed contract revision, or writes an evolution issue'，而 SKILL.md:311 首选修复是 'Refresh or re-index evidence'——刷新证据即算修复，写 evolution issue 也算出口，两者都不需要人；(3) self-audit-template.md:35 '| Repeated next action count | | | max 2 identical actions | unknown |' 是自由文本，'identical'与计数值都由被审计的 agent 本人判定和填写；(4) verify_protocol.py docstring 明确只有 Rule A（scope-lock 路径包含）与 Rule B（引用存在性），不读 decision.md 历史或 self-audit；(5) SKILL.md:493-500 的 Stop 条件里没有任何轮数/连续失败次数上限。对比：作者在 product-feedback.md 中已认领'强制力真空'总主题并交付 verify MVP，但死循环计数这条最该机械化的信号（decision.md 已是结构化序列）不在 P0-5/P1-6 任何验收项里。",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:423:   "suggestion": "给 verify_protocol.py 加 Rule C：读取 rounds/*/decision.md 的 feedback 序列与 scope-lock.md 内容哈希，'连续 N 轮非 positive 且 scope-lock 哈希未变'即非零退出（N 写入 control-contract.md，默认 3）；continue gate 在 SKILL.md 中要求先跑 verify，超限后唯一允许的 next action 是 human-confirm。这是纯机械可判规则，完全符合作者自己'代码保证下限'的架构原则。",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:428:   "verdict_reason": "逐条核实全部成立：(1) SKILL.md:473 原文确认，负反馈重复的唯一强制后果是更新 meta/self-audit.md；(2) SKILL.md:179 三个出口中\"repairs the audit failure\"和\"writes an evolution issue\"均无需人类，且 SKILL.md:311-313 将\"Refresh or re-index evidence\"列为首选最小修复，即刷新证据即可解锁下一执行轮，negative→刷新→执行→negative 循环在协议字面上被允许；(3) self-audit-template.md:35 的\"max 2 identical actions\"是全仓库唯一量化死循环阈值，位于由被审计 agent 自填的自由文本表格，\"identical\"无机械定义，grep 确认无任何脚本解析该表或读取 decision.md/feedback 历史（仅 init_project.py 复制模板）；(4) verify_protocol.py 代码确认只有 Rule A（scope-lock 路径包含）与 Rule B（引用存在性），validate.py:236-262 也只调这两条；(5) SKILL.md:493-500 与 control-contract-template.md 的 Stop Conditions 均无轮数/连续失败上限；(6) product-feedback.md:39/68/183/197 确认作者已认领\"强制力真空\"主题但 P0-5/P1-6 验收项不含死循环计数，而 decision-template.md:6 显示 feedback 已是结构化枚举，建议的 Rule C 机械可行。severity=high 校准合理：防死循环是该框架标题级承诺（SKILL.md:3、Core Contract:63），且 SKILL.md:176 与 control-contract 的 Auto-Continue 明确支持无人值守自动续轮，该模式下唯一的循环中断器是正在循环的 agent 本人的自评，失败模式为长任务无上限烧钱，符合作者自己\"代码保证下限\"原则下的下限缺口而非品味问题。",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:448:   "title": "每轮 8-10 个文件写入 + 强制委派 review + 跑成本脚本的固定下限没有任何成文裁剪路径，'single-round task' 出现 3 次但零定义（lite profile P1-3 承诺至今未落地）",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:453:   "claim": "协议对每一轮的最小固定开销是：scope-lock.md、≥1 evidence 文件、adversarial review 必须委派（含 handoff open→closed→archive 三态文件）、round-summary.md+强制运行 round_cost.py、decision.md、self-audit '每次 continuation 前必须更新'、current.md——即使改一行代码也是 8-10 次文件写 + 1 个 subagent + 1 个脚本。协议唯一的减负概念'single-round task'在全库出现 3 处（SKILL.md:232、usage.md:262、framework.md:34）但没有任何一处定义它允许省略哪个 gate。",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:454:   "evidence": "开销构成的原文依据：SKILL.md:409 'Adversarial review | Must delegate when a verifiable mechanism exists'；SKILL.md:485 每轮关闭必须 'run scripts/round_cost.py ... and paste its markdown output'；SKILL.md:293 self-audit 'must be updated during setup, before continuation, after negative or neutral feedback'；SKILL.md:379 关闭的 handoff 还需归档到 archive/。自相矛盾处：cost-model.md:135 自己把协议占比 25-50% 定义为 'Warning: the task is too small for the protocol'，>50% 为 'Stop'，但协议不提供任何降低固定下限的手段，只能靠 README 劝退小任务用户。作者已认领：product-feedback.md:194 P1-3 承诺 'lite/standard/strict 各 gate 是否可省' + quickstart（2026-07-02 承诺，目标 1.0-rc=2026-07-16 即今日）；实测 0.10.0：grep 'lite|profile|quickstart' 在 docs/、README、SKILL.md 中除一条图片生成 prompt 外零命中，docs/ 下无 quickstart.md——承诺 0 落地。",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:460:   "verdict_reason": "全部引证亲自复现：(1) 'single-round task' 全库恰好 3 处（SKILL.md:232、docs/usage.md:262、docs/harnessloop-framework.md:34），无一处定义可省略的 gate；grep 'optional|skip|omit' 在 SKILL.md/usage.md/framework.md/README 中无任何协议级裁剪语句，references/ 下 26 个模板亦无 Profile 字段。(2) 每轮固定开销属实：SKILL.md:325-339 规定每轮目录含 scope-lock.md/handoffs/evidence/reviews/round-summary.md/decision.md/archive；SKILL.md:409 原文 'Must delegate when a verifiable mechanism exists'，~433 行 'Do not accept a round with a generic engineering review alone'；SKILL.md:379 handoff 关闭后必须归档；SKILL.md:485 强制运行 round_cost.py 并粘贴输出；SKILL.md:293 self-audit 'must be updated during setup, before continuation...'——8-10 次文件写 + 1 subagent + 1 脚本的下限成立。(3) cost-model.md ~135-137 行确将 25-50% 定为 Warning'task is too small for the protocol'、>50% 为 Stop，而协议唯一出口是 README:34-37 'Do not use it for: Small edits'。(4) product-feedback.md:194 P1-3 承诺（quickstart.md + lite/standard/strict 各 gate 标注）日期 2026-07-02、1.0-rc 目标 2026-07-16（今日），实测 0.10.0（plugin.json）：docs/ 无 quickstart.md，'lite|profile|quickstart' 除 product-feedback 自身、AGENTS.md 的 -LiteralPath 和图片 prompt 外零命中，承诺 0 落地。severity 校准为 medium：发现属实且作者自认（P1），但 README 已明确将小任务排除在适用范围外，cost-model 也把固定开销定位为面向多日/高风险工作负载的保险费——实际缺陷是规范文本中的未定义术语 + 错过自设的路线图承诺，影响的是采用广度而非核心目标场景的正确性，high 虚高。",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:486:   "evidence": "文件级证据：(1) current-state-template.md 有 'Recovery round:' 字段但无 'resume target'/'interrupted task' 字段；(2) decision-template/feedback 类只有 positive/negative/neutral/blocked 四值（SKILL.md:486），positive 的唯一定义动作是前进到下一个 subgoal（SKILL.md:451 'archive and continue to the next subgoal or task'）；(3) flow 图（framework.md:539-540）RW（recovery）→ J（round scope-lock），但 J 属于哪个任务无标注；(4) 上限缺失：self-audit-template.md:26 有 'Recoverable blocker stalled' 健康检查行、:45 有 'read-only investigation before user pause' 信号行，但两处都没有次数阈值，SKILL.md:491 允许 blocked 反复进入恢复轮而 Stop 条件（493-500）不含恢复轮上限。",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:502:   "evidence": "证据：(1) init_project.py 无任何 version 字段写入（grep 'version' 0 命中），P1-4 'harnessloop_template_version' 承诺（product-feedback.md:195）0.10.0 未落地；(2) SKILL.md:320 'Create a Harnessloop evolution issue only when the failure points to the framework itself'——当 framework=project 时该条件恒真也恒假；(3) verify_protocol.py 的 Rule A 只扫 evidence/reviews，对 plugins/harnessloop/skills/ 下文件的修改（元任务的主要 business 变更）完全不可见，scope-lock 是否允许改插件文件也无约定；(4) 用户实战计划'持续迭代插件本身'意味着每轮 SKILL.md 都可能与上一轮不同，但 continue gate（continue SKILL.md:26 读取清单）不含任何协议版本比对项。旁证：作者 P1-1 承诺'本周（2026-07-02）启动 dogfooding'，0.10.0（2026-07-16）仓库根仍无 .harnessloop/（ls -la 确认），说明作者自己也尚未踩到这组问题。",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:503:   "suggestion": "两个 S 级动作：(a) init_project.py 在 state/current.md 或独立 state/protocol-version.md 写入插件版本与模板哈希，continue gate 加一条'版本不匹配→先跑 drift 确认再继续'；(b) 在 framework.md 加一节元任务约定：插件文件修改按普通 execution round 走（scope-lock 明确允许 plugins/ 路径），evolution-issues/ 仅用于'安装项目≠插件仓库'的场景，dogfooding 时直接以 goal/round 管理框架变更。",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:508:   "verdict_reason": "全部机械证据亲自复现：(1) init_project.py grep 'version' 确为 0 命中，harnessloop_template_version 仅存在于 product-feedback.md:126/195 的 P1-4 计划中，references/ 模板与脚本均未实现，plugin.json 为 0.10.0，今日恰是该文档承诺的 1.0-rc 日期；(2) SKILL.md:320 原文逐字确认\"Create a Harnessloop evolution issue only when the failure points to the framework itself\"，framework.md Meta Control 节确有\"without copying private project context into the upstream plugin\"，且 framework.md/loop SKILL.md/issue SKILL.md 对 dogfooding/元任务场景 grep 零命中，而 P1-1（product-feedback.md:147,192，2026-07-02）承诺\"本周立即启动\"dogfooding，仓库根至今无 .harnessloop/（ls 确认）——即该未定义场景是作者自己路线图上的下一步；(3) verify_protocol.py:110-115 的 checked_files 只枚举 rounds/*/evidence 与 reviews，对 plugins/harnessloop/skills/ 的修改完全不可见；(4) continue SKILL.md Processing Contract 第 1 步枚举的全部读取文件中无任何协议版本比对；(5) 反讽点成立：self-audit-template.md:36-39 对 scope-lock/goal/threshold/data-contract 的版本设\"no silent change\"规则，却无协议自身版本一行。非品味问题：版本钉扎是项目自己承诺（P1-4）未落地的能力，元任务约定由项目自己的 P1-1 计划直接触发。severity=medium 校准恰当：无即时破坏（人可手动裁决路由歧义），但 0.9→0.10 模板已实际漂移且无任何检测机制，路线图即将踩中。",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:533:   "claim": "插件的核心卖点『代码保证协议下限』（scope-lock 越界、悬空引用的机械校验）在实际使用中不会发生：verify_protocol.py 随 harnessloop-loop/scripts/ 一起安装、支持 --project 任意项目并对违规非零退出，但 Verification Phase（loop SKILL.md:432-473）和 Loop Continuation（:481-491）只要求 LLM 对抗性评审，从不指示运行该脚本；status/continue 两个 gate 技能也不提。机械门只在插件仓库自己的 scripts/validate.py 里对 examples/mock-project 跑（开发者 CI），对安装后的用户项目零覆盖。",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:592:   "title": "27 个模板中 9 个运行时核心模板（含 scope-lock/adversarial-review）在任何 SKILL.md/docs 中从未被点名，可发现性靠猜文件名",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:597:   "claim": "loop SKILL.md Output Contract 对 8 个模板给了精确文件名（handoff/self-audit/evolution-issue/transfer-packet/intake-gate/gap-review/intake-review-round），其余只说 'use the matching templates in references/'（:39-43）。goal-template、goal-breakdown-template、thresholds-template、data-contract-template、feedback-policy-template、scope-lock-template、round-summary-template、decision-template、adversarial-review-template 这 9 个 round 主路径模板全仓库零点名，agent 只能 ls 目录后按名猜（且命名不完全规则：current.md→current-state-template.md，environment.md→environment-self-check-template.md）。这直接与机械门联动：verify_protocol.py 对 scope-lock 的 Allowed Changes 只认反引号 span 或首列路径表格，agent 没找到模板自由发挥格式时会触发 unparseable-allowed-changes 硬失败——作者自己的 M1 已证明格式漂移是真实故障模式。",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:598:   "evidence": "`for t in adversarial-review-template scope-lock-template decision-template round-summary-template goal-template thresholds-template data-contract-template feedback-policy-template goal-breakdown-template; do grep -rln $t plugins/harnessloop/skills/*/SKILL.md docs/ README.md; done` 全部 0 命中；init_project.py BASE_FILES 只映射 setup/state/local/intake 的 12 个模板，goal/round 模板不在初始化产物里。",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:599:   "suggestion": "在 loop SKILL.md 的 Goal Structure 与 Round Structure 段各加一个两列映射表（协议文件 → references/ 模板路径），并在 Verification Phase 点名 adversarial-review-template.md；顺带在 scope-lock 表格上方注明 verify 认可的两种格式。",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:604:   "verdict_reason": "核心事实全部复现：(1) loop SKILL.md:38-43 精确点名 7 个模板（发现称 8 实列 7，微小计数误差），其余仅说 \"matching templates in references/\"；(2) 全仓库 grep 复现 9 个 goal/round 模板零点名——仅 scope-lock-template 出现在 verify_protocol.py 文档串、scripts/validate.py 和根目录 adversarial-review-p0.md（均非 agent 可见文档），docs/usage.md 甚至零次出现 \"template\"；(3) init_project.py:27-44 的映射只含 setup/state/local/intake/meta/evals 模板，goal/round 模板不在初始化产物；(4) verify_protocol.py extract_allowed_spans 只认反引号 span 或表格首列，否则报 unparseable-allowed-changes（~:133），且 adversarial-review-p0.md:136 的 M1 确证格式漂移曾致合规轮误判失败；另 SKILL.md:409 委派矩阵要求 reviewer 持有 \"review template\" 却从未定位它。但 severity 虚高：这 9 个模板命名实为完全规则的 <basename>-template.md（发现举的两个不规则例子是 state 文件、由 init 直接实例化，无需运行时猜名），agent 按 :43 规则 ls 后 9 个里 8 个可确定性匹配，唯 adversarial-review-template 无对应协议文件名真正不可发现；且 verify_protocol.py 未被任何运行时 skill 指令调用（仅 repo CI 对 mock-project 跑，README:262/AGENTS.md:9），\"机械门硬失败\" 链条是意图（cost-model.md:89）而非已接线的现实，SKILL.md:343-350 还内联了 scope-lock 必填字段缓解结构漂移。修复建议（映射表+点名+格式注记，S 工作量）确实普遍成立且值得做，非个人品味。",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:613:   "claim": "8 行委派矩阵全文存在于：loop SKILL.md:400-411（3.2KB≈800 tokens，每次 loop 加载都付费）、cost-context-policy-template.md（init 时复制进每个项目的 setup/cost-context-policy.md）、README:194-202、docs/harnessloop-framework.md。协议自身规定 expected model/effort 来自项目的 cost-context-policy.md（state/environment.md 记录 'Expected model and effort from policy'），但 loop:392-394 又硬编码 'For Codex, prefer subagents using gpt-5.5 with medium reasoning' / 'Sonnet with high or extra-high reasoning'——当项目 policy 填了不同型号时哪个优先未定义，且型号名会随模型迭代腐烂在已安装的插件里。",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:620:   "verdict_reason": "亲自复现全部关键事实：(1) SKILL.md:392/394 逐字硬编码 \"prefer subagents using `gpt-5.5` with medium reasoning\" 和 \"Sonnet with high or extra-high reasoning\"；docs/harnessloop-framework.md:134,293 同样硬编码。(2) references/cost-context-policy-template.md:51-65 的 Model Policy 段确为空白填写字段，且 scripts/init_project.py:28 在 init 时把它复制为每个项目的 setup/cost-context-policy.md；SKILL.md:273 又规定 environment.md 记录 \"Expected model and effort from policy\"（即项目文件）——两个事实源并存，grep 全文无 precedence/override/defer 类措辞，优先级确实未定义。(3) 矩阵重复属实但措辞略夸大：完整 6 列 8 行矩阵仅在 SKILL.md:400-411（实测 3161 字节，与所称 3.2KB≈800 tokens 吻合）；模板 :38-49 是 4 列留白的骨架、README:191-202 是 2 列 7 行压缩版（已漂移：两行被合并）、framework.md:481-492 是 3 列版，另有发现遗漏的第 5 处 docs/usage.md:272-283——各副本已出现漂移反而印证设计问题。仓库自己的 product-feedback.md:48,123 也承认此问题属实。建议（型号名移出 SKILL.md、以项目 policy 为准、矩阵全文只留模板）普遍成立且改动成本 S，非个人品味。severity 校准：实际损害为每次加载约 800 tokens（SKILL.md 共 30KB）、\"when available\" 措辞使型号过时时优雅降级、歧义最坏后果是子代理选型次优而非循环失败，medium 虚高，降为 low。",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:710:   "evidence": "矛盾对照：SKILL.md:485『run scripts/round_cost.py --project <target-project> and paste its markdown output』无环境条件；round_cost.py:43-45 `Path.home() / \".claude\" / \"projects\" / escaped`；Codex 会话记录在 ~/.codex/sessions 且为 rollout 事件格式（token_count 事件），即使 --transcript-dir 指过去 schema 也不匹配。plugins/harnessloop/.codex-plugin/plugin.json `\"skills\": \"./skills/\"` 证明 Codex 装的是同一 SKILL.md。协议自身的 state/environment.md 已记录 codex/claude-code 环境类型（SKILL.md:269-271），但收尾步骤未消费它。",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:711:   "suggestion": "最小改动：SKILL.md 第 1 步改为『当 state/environment.md 为 claude-code 时运行 round_cost.py；其他环境记录 cost unavailable: unsupported platform』，并在 README Cost Accountability 段与 cost-model.md 顶部明写『目前仅 Claude Code transcript 支持自动结算』；后续再补 ~/.codex/sessions 适配器。",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:716:   "verdict_reason": "事实链全部亲自验证：(1) SKILL.md:485 Loop Continuation 第 1 步无条件要求每轮运行 round_cost.py；(2) round_cost.py:43-45 默认目录写死 ~/.claude/projects/<escaped>，92-107 行只解析 Claude Code JSONL schema（type=assistant + message.usage）；(3) 在系统临时目录构造 fixture 复现：Codex-only 环境下脚本 exit 2 'Transcript directory not found'；再以 Codex rollout 格式（token_count 事件）JSONL 传 --transcript-dir，脚本 exit 0 但静默报 0 tokens，schema 不匹配论断成立；(4) .codex-plugin/plugin.json \"skills\": \"./skills/\" 与 install-codex.sh（codex plugin add）确认同一 SKILL.md 发布到 Codex，README:42-70 宣传 Codex 安装；(5) README Cost Accountability 段（~207-219）无平台限定；(6) SKILL.md:271 的 environment.md 确记录 codex/claude-code 但收尾步骤未消费。改进建议合理且 effort S。但 severity 虚高：SKILL.md:485 同句已写明降级路径 'If it exits non-zero, record cost as unavailable with the reason'，脚本 stderr 也主动指引记录原因——协议不中断、可自诊断；且 README 该段直接链接 docs/cost-model.md，其第 55 行明写 'Claude Code session transcripts'，披露仅在一跳之外而非缺失。实际用户影响是 Codex 每轮多一条 cost unavailable 记录，故降为 low。",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:784:   "title": "examples/mock-project 的 round-summary.md 与 scope-lock.md 偏离自家模板：缺 ## Cost/## Decision 等全部模板节、标题命名不一致，参考示例教坏 pattern-matching 的 agent",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:789:   "claim": "README:246 把 mock-project 定位为『artificial reference project showing setup, intake, evidence, review, decision, self-audit, and evolution issue files』，agent 实际运行协议时会以它为范例。但其 round-summary.md 只有 3 句散文，round-summary-template.md 规定的 ## Round / ## Evidence Produced / ## Review Result / ## Cost / ## Decision / ## Blocker Classification 等节全部缺失（SKILL.md:485 已把 ## Cost 定为每轮必填）；scope-lock.md 用 `## Objective` / `## Verification` 而模板是 `## Round Objective` / `## Verification Commands Or Checks`，且缺模板的 One-Variable Strict Mode 与 Runtime Recovery Limits 节。verify_protocol.py 只解析 `## Allowed Changes`，validate 七关对 round-summary 结构零检查，此类漂移永远绿灯——这正是 P0-4 在文档侧消灭过的『示例/模板漂移』在 example 侧复现。",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:790:   "evidence": "实测 cat 对照：mock round-summary.md 全文 5 行无任何 ## 小节 vs references/round-summary-template.md 的 11 个小节（含 ## Cost）；mock scope-lock.md `## Objective`/`## Verification` vs references/scope-lock-template.md `## Round Objective`/`## Verification Commands Or Checks`；grep '## Cost' examples/ 零命中；validate.py 第 5 关仅调 verify_protocol.verify_project（validate.py:238-239），不校验 round 文件结构。",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:791:   "suggestion": "按模板重写 mock-project 的 round-summary.md（含一个真实样式的 ## Cost 块，可标注 synthetic）和 scope-lock.md 标题；在 validate.py 第 5 关加一条廉价断言：mock-project 每个 round 的 round-summary.md 必须包含模板级小节集合（至少 ## Cost 与 ## Decision），防止示例再次漂移。",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:796:   "verdict_reason": "全部证据亲自复现：(1) examples/mock-project/.../rounds/0001/round-summary.md 实测仅 3 句散文、零 ## 小节，而 references/round-summary-template.md 规定 10 个小节含 ## Cost/## Decision/## Blocker Classification；(2) mock scope-lock.md 用 ## Objective/## Verification，模板为 ## Round Objective/## Verification Commands Or Checks，且缺 ## One-Variable Strict Mode 与 ## Runtime Recovery Limits；(3) README.md:246 原文确将 mock-project 定位为 'artificial reference project'；(4) SKILL.md:485 原文确将 ## Cost 定为每轮必填；(5) grep '## Cost' examples/ 实测 exit 1 零命中；(6) verify_protocol.py:50-60 确认只解析 '## Allowed Changes' 一节（mock 恰好保留了这唯一被校验的节）；(7) validate.py 第 5 关（:235-239）仅调 verify_protocol.verify_project，全文件对 'round-summary' 零提及，漂移永不触发失败；(8) 仓库无任何'示例为简化版'的豁免声明；(9) P0-4 类比经 adversarial-review-p0.md:18/:139 核实框架引用准确。severity=low 校准恰当：示例与强制模板真实矛盾但无运行时破坏，agent 首要指令源仍是 SKILL.md 与模板，示例仅为次级污染源。",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:854:   "evidence": "矛盾对照：docs 与 loop SKILL.md:151 承诺 'No secret values are stored in Harnessloop files.' 作为验收条件，但 verify_protocol.py docstring（:4-12）自述仅实现 Rule A/B，grep 全部 scripts 无任何 token/entropy/PEM 模式扫描。作者基线 product-feedback.md:39 已认领泛化的'强制力真空'，P0-5 只补了 scope-lock 与 citation 两条；secret 扫描这条具体缺口在 adversarial-review-p0.md 中未被认领（其 m7/nm11/nm12 均与此无关）。",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:908:   "verdict_reason": "亲自复现：在 scratchpad fixture 中用 init_project.py 初始化后，.harnessloop/local/ 下放置 creds.json/.env/id_rsa/cert.p12/config.yaml，git check-ignore 全部返回 NOT IGNORED，git add -A 会将其全部暂存提交；模板 local-gitignore-template.txt 确为 7 行固定枚举。文本锚点全部核实：harnessloop-secrets/SKILL.md:25 承诺覆盖 \"other local secret material\"，:48 引导存入 \"the local ignored file\"，harnessloop-loop/SKILL.md:79 标注 local/=never committed。附带的 drift 也复现：channel_params.py 的 DEFAULT_IGNORE_LINES（channel_params.py:18-25）缺 cost-marker.json，单独 init 生成的 gitignore 不忽略 cost-marker.json。白名单反转建议是该目录语义的标准做法且 S 级成本，非个人品味。severity=low 校准恰当：设计主路径（channel-params.json 经 channel_params.py 存储）本身受保护，暴露需要偏离文档路径的文件名 + 显式 git add，属 footgun 而非现行泄漏。",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:919:   "suggestion": "设计一个 setup wizard 环节（可放在 init 的 After Initialization、或新增 $harnessloop-setup 动作）：固定顺序五步——(1) 自动检测环境写 state/environment.md；(2) AskUserQuestion 逐项引导 setup/data-sources.md（静态源/动态源/运行时验证系统，每类问『有没有、访问方式、验证命令』，允许回答 none）；(3) 展示 cost-context-policy 默认值让用户确认或改；(4) AskUserQuestion 选项式确认 control-contract 的 auto-continue/human-confirm/stop 偏好；(5) 汇总写 state/self-check.md 并输出『setup 完成度 N/5，下一步：X』。每步可跳过但必须显式记 TODO 到 self-check.md。同时把 loop:114 的触发条件改为『.harnessloop/ 不存在，或 setup 文件含未填字段』。",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:923:   "verdict_reason": "缺口真实：loop SKILL.md:69 的 Project Setup 节触发条件确为“.harnessloop/ 不存在”，:114 是全协议唯一的填表指令且只覆盖 data-sources；init SKILL.md:90 交接语只提 goal，init:35 在目录已存在时直接建议 $harnessloop-loop；grep 全部 12 个 SKILL.md 证实其余 skill（channels/connectivity/delegation/secrets）只读 setup 文件、无任何 skill 承担填表职责；init_project.py 恰创建 12 个空骨架文件，模板无 TODO/status 驱动器；协议多处预设“setup 阶段”存在（loop:291/293）却从未定义 init 后的触发时机。建议不违反硬性原则：AskUserQuestion 是协议已背书机制（loop:192/194），环境检测是 environment.md 既有语义，policy 默认值源自协议自身 Role And Model Rules 而非虚构项目事实，可跳过+记 TODO 与 init:81 一致。但 severity 过评：协议有反应式兜底（loop:192-196、connectivity、continue 步骤7/10 均强制缺参时问用户、禁止推断），空模板不会导致虚构或不安全执行，只导致 loop 中途零散被动补问；且“永远不会被触发”过强——:114 的 During setup 是有歧义的提示词而非硬编码条件。缺口是首跑体验/主动性缺陷（打击 init→loop 主路径每个新用户），非正确性/安全性缺陷，应降为 high。",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:932:   "claim": "status 的状态枚举只有 initialized | not-initialized | inconsistent | blocked，continue 的 decision 枚举也没有 needs-setup；state/self-check.md 号称记录『setup and continuation gate checks』（loop SKILL.md:291）但没有任何 skill 定义 setup gate 何时运行、由谁填写、通过标准是什么；verify_protocol.py 只做 Rule A/B（scope-lock 包含性和引用存在性）。新用户跑 $harnessloop-status 得到的是『initialized』——12 个空模板对协议来说是不可见的。",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:942:   "title": "state/environment.md 要求记录『Detected environment / Available tools』，但没有任何环节指示插件在 init/setup 时自动检测填写",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:948:   "evidence": "environment-self-check-template.md:8-14 'Detected environment: codex | claude-code | other | unknown / Detected from: / Available tools:' 全空；loop SKILL.md:269 'state/environment.md records detected environment' 无动词主语和时机；harnessloop-continue/SKILL.md:26 要求读 state/environment.md 作为 environment gate 输入，但未定义空文件时的分支。",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:949:   "suggestion": "在 init 的 After Initialization（或 setup wizard 第 1 步）中明确要求：agent 立即自检并写入 environment.md 的 Detection 与 Delegation 节——检测到自己运行在 claude-code/codex、可用的委派机制（Task/subagent/swarm）、已知模型名，Expected model 按 cost-context-policy 或平台默认填写，仅把 Observed model/effort 留给 $harnessloop-delegation 后续验证；Result 节写 pass + Last checked 时间戳。这一步全程无需用户输入，是最典型的『应自动配置却推给用户』的环节。",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:953:   "verdict_reason": "缺口真实：environment-self-check-template.md:6-14 的 Detection 节全空，init_project.py:30 将其原样复制为 state/environment.md；全部 12 个 SKILL.md 中没有任何一步把「检测并填写」动作分配给 init 或 setup——loop SKILL.md:269 只说该文件 records detected environment（无主语无时机），Project Setup 节只要求用户填 data-sources.md，init SKILL.md:81 明确把未知值留作 TODO 而 loop 的 setup 从未接手；唯一会写 environment.md 的是 harnessloop-delegation（step 8），且仅在显式调用时。建议可行且不违反硬性原则：检测到的宿主环境/可用工具是会话内可观察事实而非虚构，写协议状态文件本就是框架常规动作（delegation skill 同样无确认写入），且建议正确地把 Observed model/effort 留给 $harnessloop-delegation 验证，符合其 SKILL.md:33 的 unknown 规则；修复全程无需用户输入，是纯正的主动性提升。两处需下调的点：(1) 证据中「continue 首次运行行为未定义」被夸大——harnessloop-continue SKILL.md:35（step 10）已定义分支：environment 要求缺失/含糊时询问用户，即行为是「降级为向用户索要 agent 自己零成本可知的事实」，是摩擦而非未定义/破坏；(2) 建议中「Result 节写 pass」应改为 pass 并记录 Residual risk（Delegation 节 observed 值在 init 时未验证，无条件 pass 会触碰 loop SKILL.md:112 不得虚构验证结果的边界）。因协议有定义好的回退、且 Delegation/Model 节在依赖委派前由 loop SKILL.md:413-422 强制补录，实际影响是每次新装的首次 gate 摩擦而非执行错误，severity 由 high 校准为 medium。",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:1009:   "suggestion": "init_project.py 的 result dict 增加 needs_user_input（setup/data-sources.md、setup/cost-context-policy.md、state/control-contract.md）与 auto_fillable（state/environment.md、state/self-check.md）两组固定分类并在文本/JSON 输出中打印；init SKILL 的 After Initialization 相应要求以三层清单呈现：『需要你提供的（3）→ 我可以自动填的（2）→ 运行中自动维护的（7）』，并把『需要你提供的』第一项作为下一步。这是纯输出层改动，一次实现即长期消除迷茫。",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:1013:   "verdict_reason": "缺口属实：init_project.py:147-155 的文本输出与 result dict（96-105 行）确实只有 created_dirs/written/skipped 等无差别分组；harnessloop-init/SKILL.md:83-92 的 After Initialization 报告也无任何 needs-your-input 分类；12 个文件计数正确（9 BASE + 2 LOCAL + 1 INTAKE）；抽查的模板（data-sources、control-contract、environment-self-check 等）全是空冒号字段，27 个模板中 grep 无任何填写归属标注。协议其它文件仅部分覆盖：init SKILL:90 给出唯一下一步（$harnessloop-loop），loop SKILL:114 要求 setup 时向用户询问 data-sources——所以『用户完全不知道从哪开始』有夸大（跟随推荐流程的用户有明确入口）；但『哪些文件等用户输入 vs 哪些 agent 自动维护』的分类信息在 12 个 SKILL.md 和 27 个模板中确实不存在（loop setup 只对 data-sources 明确要求问用户，cost-context-policy 和 control-contract 无 ask-user 指令，docs/usage.md:47-61 只描述文件用途不标注填写归属）。建议不违反硬性原则：分类是协议自身的结构性事实而非虚构项目事实（environment.md/self-check.md 归为 agent 自动填与 loop SKILL:269-275/291 一致，control-contract 归为需用户输入与 contract control 的人工干预语义一致），纯输出层改动，无静默替代工具、无未确认写入，effort S 可行。severity 下调：该缺口只影响首次初始化的定向体验，不阻塞协议运行（loop 的各 gate 会在需要时逐项向用户索取缺失信息），且已有『下一步提示』部分缓解，medium 高估，应为 low。",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:1037:   "claim": "初始化完成后用户面对 9 个满是空字段的协议文件（environment.md、control-contract.md、data-sources.md、cost-context-policy.md 等），harnessloop-init 的『After Initialization』只报文件清单和一句『Next recommended prompt: Use $harnessloop-loop』，没有 setup 完整度报告，也没有引导式逐文件补全流程；harnessloop-loop 的 Project Setup 一节也只有一句『ask the user to fill in data-source connection requirements』。用户必须自己猜每个文件该填什么、按什么顺序填、填到什么程度算够。",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:1039:   "suggestion": "在 harnessloop-init 的 After Initialization 增加两个主动步骤：(1) 输出 Setup 完整度报告——逐一列出 9 个可填写文件，标记 template-empty / partially-filled / complete（与 references/ 模板原文 diff 或统计空 'Field:' 行即可判定）；(2) 主动提议进入引导式补全，按依赖顺序 environment.md（先自动检测预填）→ control-contract.md（选 profile 档位）→ data-sources.md（先扫描 repo 出候选）→ cost-context-policy.md，每个文件用 2-3 个 askuserquestion 收敛，agent 代填后请用户确认。",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:1043:   "verdict_reason": "核心缺口属实但范围被夸大。属实部分：(1) harnessloop-init SKILL.md 83-92 行 After Initialization 确仅报文件清单+一句 next prompt，无完整度报告；(2) init_project.py 确创建 12 个文件(BASE 9+LOCAL 2+INTAKE 1)，模板确为空冒号字段；(3) grep 全部 12 个 SKILL.md 无任何 guided-fill/interview 流程，唯一填写指令是 loop SKILL.md:114 一句 data-sources；(4) 加重证据：init SKILL.md:81 把 TODO 推给\"first $harnessloop-loop setup round\"，但 grep 全插件+docs 该 setup round 从未被定义——悬空引用。夸大部分：\"用户必须自己猜每个文件\"不成立——交互模型是 agent 代理式：12 个文件中 3 个是无需填写的基础设施(.gitignore/example.json)，约 5 个是 agent 在轮次中自行维护的控制面文件(current/evidence-index/self-check/self-audit/evals)，environment.md 由 agent 自动检测，loop SKILL 254-295 行和 usage.md 49-59 行已为 agent 规定每个文件的必填内容；真正依赖用户输入的仅 data-sources/cost-context-policy/control-contract 约 2-3 个。建议不违反硬性原则：完整度报告只读；引导补全明确经 askuserquestion+用户确认后写入(框架已 7 处强制 askuserquestion)；environment 自动检测预填本就是协议行为；repo 扫描出候选属\"提议待确认\"非虚构事实。唯一张力是 init 自称 initialization only，引导补全宜作为向 loop setup round 的 handoff 而非塞进 init。severity 从 critical 校准为 medium：真实的首跑摩擦+悬空协议引用，但非正确性/安全故障。",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:1047:   "title": "environment.md 几乎全部字段可在 Claude Code 会话内自动检测，但协议反而禁止推断且无任何自动填充步骤",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:1053:   "evidence": "environment-self-check-template.md 第 6-54 行全部为空字段；harnessloop-loop/SKILL.md 第 269 行只说 'state/environment.md records detected environment' 但无检测步骤；harnessloop-delegation/SKILL.md 第 25 行 'Do not infer model, effort, tool identity, delegation mechanism... from surrounding context'、第 76 行禁止 branding 推断。grep 'detect' 在所有 SKILL.md 中无任何检测指令命中。",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:1054:   "suggestion": "在 harnessloop-loop SKILL.md 增设『Trusted in-session signals』白名单：环境变量（CLAUDECODE 等）、系统提示自述的模型 ID、当前工具枚举、一次 bounded read-only probe 子任务的实际行为（要求写指定输出路径+引用证据，回收后即同时验证 4 个 delegation 能力字段）。harnessloop-init 完成后或首次 loop 运行时依白名单自动填充 environment.md，每个值标注 detection source，最后用一个 askuserquestion 让用户确认全表；仅 Expected model/effort 与 Mismatch action 留为提问项。",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:1058:   "verdict_reason": "Core gap verified: environment-self-check-template.md (lines 6-54) is all blank fields and init_project.py copies it verbatim to state/environment.md; grep 'detect' across all 12 SKILL.md files hits only the loop SKILL.md:269 label ('records detected environment') and the template — no detection procedure, no mention of CLAUDECODE/env vars/system-prompt model ID/tool enumeration anywhere in the plugin or its 27 templates. The quoted prohibitions exist verbatim (delegation SKILL.md:25 'Do not infer model, effort, tool identity, delegation mechanism... from surrounding context'; :76 branding rule). Impact is mainline: continue step 10 asks the user when environment fields are missing, and the delegation matrix's mandatory adversarial-review delegation degrades to 'unknown'/main-session-only when environment.md stays blank; the framework itself branches on environment identity (loop:392-394) and the mock example shows a filled environment.md, proving intent with no procedure — an internal inconsistency. Two overstatements noted but not verdict-changing: (1) the protocol does not fully block first-hand harness facts — line 76 says 'from product branding ALONE' and delegation input line 20 accepts 'reliable metadata', it merely never whitelists in-session signals, so the compliant default collapses to asking the user; (2) users answer agent questions rather than literally hand-typing 15 fields (delegation step 8 authorizes the agent to write environment.md). The suggestion is feasible and conflicts with no hard principle: detected values are direct observation with sources recorded (not invented facts), no tool substitution is involved, environment.md is a protocol state file the framework already writes, the read-only probe with required output path matches the framework's own handoff pattern, and the single batched askuserquestion confirmation reduces net interruption versus per-fact questions. Severity high is calibrated for a proactivity review: every project init hits this, and it silently weakens the core verification-delegation path, though the loop remains functional via manual answers.",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:1073:   "verdict_reason": "Gap is real: loop SKILL.md:114 quote verified verbatim; data-sources-template.md:8-31 is 5 header-only tables; usage.md:61 verified; zero scan keywords in both SKILL.md files and no scanning logic in the 3 bundled scripts (init_project.py/round_cost.py/verify_protocol.py); init SKILL.md:23 even says \"Do not infer project facts... data sources.\" Across all 12 skills and 27 templates the only related coverage is goal-breakdown-template.md's Read-Only Discovery Plan (\"Runtime validation options\") which runs after setup and never feeds back into setup/data-sources.md — so users do face 5 blank tables at setup. The mock example itself records `npm test -- --runInBand`, proving such facts are repo-detectable. The suggestion does not violate hard principles: scan-with-citation + Status=proposed-unconfirmed + grouped user confirmation is detection, not invention, and matches the framework's own evidence ethos (repository source is a declared evidence class, every claim must cite paths); no tool substitution; the no-unconfirmed-write rules are scoped to external systems while .harnessloop files are protocol-owned. Only mild tension is init's \"do not infer project facts\" wording, resolvable by placing the scan as an explicit confirmed setup step as the suggestion proposes. Severity downgraded: one-time onboarding friction, not correctness/safety; partial downstream mitigation via discovery handoffs and the filled mock example — medium, not high.",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:1077:   "title": "control-contract 没有 lite/standard/strict 预设档位（已核实协议全文无 profile 概念），用户须从零填约 20 个策略字段",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:1082:   "claim": "已核实：grep lite/strict/standard/profile，协议中仅存在 scope-lock 的『one-variable strict mode』（SKILL.md 第 55、351 行），不存在 control-contract 档位概念。control-contract-template.md 有 Auto-Continue / Human Confirmation / Stop Conditions / Delegation Boundaries / Acceptance Authority 约 20 个空字段，全是策略性判断，新用户既不懂协议语义也无参考默认值，只有 Blocker Classification 一张表是预填的。这是 continue 门控的核心依赖文件——填不好整个 loop 都跑不动。",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:1083:   "evidence": "control-contract-template.md 第 8-66 行除 Blocker 表外全为空冒号字段；grep -riE 'profile|lite' 在 plugins/ docs/ README.md 中仅命中 strict mode（scope-lock）与无关词；examples/mock-project/.harnessloop/state/control-contract.md 是唯一的已填参考但没有任何 skill 指向它作为默认值来源。",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:1084:   "suggestion": "新增 references/control-contract-profiles.md 定义三档完整预设：lite（个人项目：positive+evidence-fresh 即自动续跑，仅外部写需确认）、standard（默认：模板 Blocker 表+常规确认项）、strict（涉外部系统/敏感数据：所有写操作与合同变更均需人确认）。harnessloop-init 补全环节只问一个问题『项目风险档位？』即写出整份已填合同，用户按 diff 微调；harnessloop-continue 遇到无法评估的空合同时（现状会 needs-evidence 卡死）主动提议按档位补全而非仅报 contract-insufficient。",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:1088:   "verdict_reason": "缺口真实：control-contract-template.md 第6-66行有24个空政策字段（Auto-Continue 5/Human Confirmation 6/Stop Conditions 6/Delegation 3/Acceptance Authority 4），仅Blocker表预填；init_project.py:31逐字落盘该空模板；grep全部12个SKILL.md、27个模板、docs与README确认无profile/preset/lite概念（唯一strict是scope-lock的one-variable strict mode，loop SKILL.md:55,351）；init与setup补全指引只覆盖data-sources和cost-context-policy（loop SKILL.md:114-130），从不引导填control-contract；mock-project的已填样例无任何skill指向且自身缺Delegation Boundaries/Acceptance Authority两节和3个blocker类型，抄都抄不全。门控依赖属实：harnessloop-continue步骤1-2须confirm action matches the control contract，loop SKILL.md:178规定contract health fails则do not execute。建议不违反硬性原则：档位是用户显式选择的框架级政策预设而非被禁的虚构项目事实；init一问后写入即含用户确认；continue主动提议补全是提案，与现有contract-insufficient→repair before execution（user input: maybe）语义一致。两处轻微不准不改变结论：(a)实际决策值是blocked+contract-insufficient而非needs-evidence，且协议已有修复路径、缺的是默认值；(b)verify_protocol.py对合同内容零检查，卡死是遵规agent行为而非机械强制。实现注意：lite档须保留协议硬编码的人确认项（合同修订、failed-review接受，continue SKILL.md步骤4与Safety Rules末条）。severity维持high：每个新init项目均命中，落在最常用continue关键路径，一问替代24个政策字段净减打扰。",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:1097:   "claim": "self-check-template.md 的『Setup files present / Environment policy recorded / Control contract recorded / Evidence index recorded / Self-audit present』等字段全部可以用『文件存在且内容不等于原始模板』机械判定，但 verify_protocol.py 只实现了 Rule A（scope-lock 包含）和 Rule B（引用存在性），不检查 setup 完整度；结果是 self-check.md 本身也成了一个要用户手填的空模板——用『手填的检查表』去检查『手填是否完成』，循环空转。",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:1103:   "verdict_reason": "Gap is real: self-check-template.md (lines 6-17) is all empty fields, init_project.py BASE_FILES copies it verbatim to state/self-check.md, and verify_protocol.py's docstring/code confirm only Rule A (scope-lock containment) and Rule B (citation existence) are enforced — no setup-completeness check exists in any of the 12 SKILL.md files, 27 templates, or scripts (repo-root validate.py validates the plugin repo, not user-project setup). harnessloop-status #4 and harnessloop-continue #10 only give qualitative model-judgment instructions ('report missing state files', 'ask when ambiguous'); nothing distinguishes still-blank-template from filled or quantifies completeness. The suggestion does not conflict with hard principles: a detection script observes file state (invents no facts), status running a read-only local script and reporting a percentage writes nothing (local scripts are not the 'external systems' status forbids probing), and the self-check.md paste happens in loop/continue which are authorized to write protocol files; verify_protocol.py's own philosophy ('enforces only machine-checkable rules') supports adding these machine-checkable presence checks. BASE_FILES already provides the file→template mapping, so effort M is realistic, and specific 'fill X next' guidance reduces rather than adds interruption. Minor overstatements — the title's 'all fields purely mechanical' is wrong for judgment fields like 'Delegation model verified' (mock project marks it unknown), and status does have a qualitative missing-file instruction — keep this at medium, not high: it is an ergonomics/automation gap, not a correctness defect.",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:1133:   "verdict_reason": "缺口真实：init_project.py (L38-45, L94-131) 无条件写入 local/.gitignore 与 intake/.gitignore 且全插件无任何 git 仓库检测——12 个 SKILL.md、27 个模板、channel_params.py audit（只 grep .gitignore 内容，L443-472）、environment-self-check（只测 agent 运行时/模型）、intake gate（不核验 Current branch）均无覆盖。建议属\"检测后一次性告知\"，不违反禁虚构/禁静默替代/禁无确认写入的硬原则。但三处夸大需校准：(1) \"保护完全失效\"错误——git 尊重工作树内嵌套 .gitignore，monorepo 子目录（无本地 .git）场景保护完全有效，纯非 git 项目本无 git commit 威胁且 .gitignore 在日后 git init 时立即生效；非 git 同步工具的泄露风险在 git 仓库中同样存在，.gitignore 本就防不了。(2) \"rollback 语义无从谈起\"不成立——协议 rollback 是通用概念（eval-matrix、scope-lock 均不依赖 git）。(3) 建议的 (project/'.git').exists() 一行检测在常见 monorepo 子目录场景会误报\"非 git 仓库\"，反而制造打扰，需改为向上遍历父目录找 .git（仍零子进程，effort 仍 S）。独有价值仅是初始化时一条信息性提示，故 severity 由 medium 降为 low。",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:1219:   "suggestion": "在 Self-Audit 一节增加用户呈现条款：dead-loop 或任何 fail 触发时，必须在聊天输出循环诊断摘要（重复的 feedback 序列、重复动作次数、涉及的轮次编号、证据增量为零的证明路径），并以 2-4 个选项（缩小 scope-lock / 回滚某轮 / 人工修订契约 / 终止目标）用 askuserquestion 让用户选择；harnessloop-continue 返回 needs-self-audit 决策时必须附带同一摘要。",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:1223:   "verdict_reason": "缺口真实：核对全部 12 个 SKILL.md 与 27 个模板后，dead-loop 检测结果（self-audit-template.md L30-45 的 Deterministic Signals 表）确实只写入 meta/self-audit.md；loop SKILL.md L311-318 的 6 项修复全为文件操作；harnessloop-continue 输出契约（L66）中 self-audit 仅一行 'self-audit gate:'，harnessloop-status 也仅一行 'self-audit state:'；L179 明确允许 self-audit fail 后不经用户即以本地修复/写 evolution issue 继续。continue 步骤 10 的 askuserquestion 只覆盖'missing or ambiguous'而非明确的 dead-loop fail，无任何条款要求在聊天中呈现循环诊断（重复序列/次数/轮次/零证据增量）或提供选项菜单。建议与硬性原则不冲突：askuserquestion 正是协议自身在 7 处使用的模式，呈现文件已有信号不虚构事实、不涉及写入，且提议的选项（rollback/contract revision）本就是协议要求人确认的动作。两点校正：(1) 发现称'最多看到一行'略夸张——continue 输出还有 decision: needs-self-audit、blocker type、human decision 等行，且 scope-lock mutation/rollback 修复路径本身需人确认，用户并非完全盲区；(2) 建议中'任何 fail 都必须弹选项菜单'过宽，与 L311 'smallest local repair first' 及 L176 反对不必要暂停的设计意图相悖，应收窄为 dead-loop 或重复修复失败（可用信号表 max 2 identical actions 阈值作升级条件）。severity 维持 medium：缺口真实且死循环是高价值告知时刻，但 fail 时执行被阻止、部分修复需人确认、用户可查 status，存在部分缓解。",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:1232:   "claim": "协议要求每轮收盘都跑 round_cost.py，但脚本把 transcript 路径写死在 ~/.claude/projects 下；框架官方支持的 Codex 环境（install-codex.sh、environment.md 的 codex 枚举）没有这个目录，每一轮都会失败，而 stderr 不告诉用户'这在你的环境属预期'，也不提示覆盖项。symlink 或从子目录运行导致 escaped 路径不匹配时同样静默失败。",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:1262:   "claim": "用户看到 '[unparseable-allowed-changes] no backtick path spans found…' 时并不知道：这意味着本轮不能被接受、正确格式是在 '## Allowed Changes' 下用反引号或表格首列写路径、参考文件是 scope-lock-template.md。尤其 unparseable-allowed-changes 是格式坑——用户写了纯文本路径就会全轮判违规，错误信息却只描述现象。",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:1263:   "evidence": "main()（L195-199）逐条打印 '[kind] detail' 后仅输出 'N violation(s) found.' 并 return 1；三类 violation（missing-scope-lock / unparseable-allowed-changes / dangling-citation，L119-164）的 detail 都只陈述事实，无 fix 提示、无后果说明、无参考模板指向。",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:1264:   "suggestion": "每类 violation 打印后附一行 'fix:'：unparseable-allowed-changes → '在 ## Allowed Changes 下用反引号包路径或使用 scope-lock-template.md 的表格格式'；dangling-citation → '修正 review 中的引用路径或补齐对应证据文件'；missing-scope-lock → '为该轮创建 scope-lock.md（模板：references/scope-lock-template.md）'。结尾补一句协议后果：'违规未修复前该轮不能被接受，修复后重跑本命令'。",
docs/harnessloop-review-20260716.findings.json:1268:   "verdict_reason": "代码核实属实：verify_protocol.py L119-164 各类 violation 的 detail 仅陈述现象，main() L195-199 逐条打印后仅输出计数并 exit 1，无 fix 提示、无后果说明、无模板指向。unparseable-allowed-changes 的消息尤其有误导性——只提 backtick spans，而 extract_allowed_spans (L49-77) 同样接受 scope-lock-template.md 的表格首列格式，照模板留空表格的用户会收到与模板不符的报错提示。缺口确实无处覆盖：grep 全部 12 个 SKILL.md、27 个模板及 usage.md/harnessloop-framework.md/README，均未解释任何 violation kind 或修复动作（唯一提及处是 adversarial-review-p0.md 审查工件）。建议不违反硬性原则：fix 文案与代码实际接受格式一致（非虚构），后果句与 SKILL.md L445「review must cite evidence paths... the round fails」及 scope-lock 门禁语义一致，纯输出增强、仅失败时显示、无写入无工具替换，effort S 合理。severity 维持 low 正确校准：该脚本的 CLI 输出路径不在任何文档化工作流中（无 SKILL.md 引用它，主消费者 validate.py 以 import verify_project() 方式绕过 main()），实际受众仅限手动运行者。次要瑕疵：finding 列了三类 violation，代码实有四类（scope-lock-violation L148 同样无 fix 提示），但这强化而非削弱核心主张。",
harnessloop/plugins/harnessloop/skills/harnessloop-channels/SKILL.md:3:description: "Use when the user references harnessloop:channels or asks to list all external systems, access channels, tools, MCP servers, CLIs, APIs, CI systems, databases, broker services, or other integrations declared in Harnessloop evidence contracts, data sources, transfer packets, goals, rounds, or handoffs. This skill is inventory-only and must not probe connectivity."
harnessloop/plugins/harnessloop/skills/harnessloop-channels/SKILL.md:8:List all declared external systems, channels, and tools that Harnessloop may rely on. This skill produces an inventory; it does not test connectivity, infer missing tools, or call external systems.
harnessloop/plugins/harnessloop/skills/harnessloop-channels/SKILL.md:12:Accept an explicit skill invocation such as `$harnessloop-channels`, or natural language asking to list external systems/tools/channels. Treat `harnessloop:channels` as a natural-language alias only; `$harnessloop:channels` is not a valid skill invocation.
harnessloop/plugins/harnessloop/skills/harnessloop-channels/SKILL.md:25:2. Extract only declared external systems, tools, channels, accounts, credential references, local parameter references, permissions, required parameters, verification methods, failure handling, and sensitivity labels.
harnessloop/plugins/harnessloop/skills/harnessloop-channels/SKILL.md:28:5. Do not call tools, probe endpoints, check credentials, run CLIs, or access external systems.
harnessloop/plugins/harnessloop/skills/harnessloop-goal/SKILL.md:28:1. Read `.harnessloop/state/current.md`, active goal files, `goal.md`, `goal-breakdown.md`, `thresholds.md`, `data-contract.md`, `feedback-policy.md`, active round `scope-lock.md`, latest `decision.md`, and `state/evidence-index.md` when present.
harnessloop/plugins/harnessloop/skills/harnessloop-goal/SKILL.md:66:- If the active round scope-lock, evidence contract, thresholds, or feedback policy is affected, block continuation until `$harnessloop-continue` runs the gate.
harnessloop/plugins/harnessloop/skills/harnessloop-goal/SKILL.md:86:$harnessloop-goal cancel active goal; human confirmed because the external dependency was removed
harnessloop/plugins/harnessloop/skills/harnessloop-evidence/SKILL.md:21:- `applies-to`: project setup, goal, threshold, round, scope-lock, review, or decision.
harnessloop/plugins/harnessloop/skills/harnessloop-evidence/SKILL.md:25:- `external-system`: required when evidence depends on reading from or writing to an external system; include system name, operation, endpoint or resource identifier, required account/role, permission scope, credential reference without secret value, required parameters, and access verification method.
harnessloop/plugins/harnessloop/skills/harnessloop-evidence/SKILL.md:26:- `channel-parameters`: required when an external channel needs reusable local parameters; include parameter keys, sensitivity, storage method, and whether values should be user-set or locally stored through `$harnessloop-secrets`.
harnessloop/plugins/harnessloop/skills/harnessloop-evidence/SKILL.md:27:- `blocker-type`: optional classification for blocked evidence: runtime-recoverable, access-missing, write-safety-required, human-decision-required, contract-insufficient, external-system-unsafe, or unknown.
harnessloop/plugins/harnessloop/skills/harnessloop-evidence/SKILL.md:35:For external-system evidence, missing connection conditions or parameters are a hard stop. Ask the user immediately for the missing facts; do not infer endpoint names, account roles, credential locations, permission scopes, request parameters, write semantics, or fallback access paths. If a channel requires reusable parameters, route to `$harnessloop-secrets` to create or check local parameter keys before connectivity or evidence collection.
harnessloop/plugins/harnessloop/skills/harnessloop-evidence/SKILL.md:37:When asking for missing external-system facts, use `askuserquestion` when it is available; otherwise ask directly in chat. Ask for only the missing fields needed to proceed.
harnessloop/plugins/harnessloop/skills/harnessloop-evidence/SKILL.md:41:Use `$harnessloop-channels` to list declared external systems/tools/channels before connectivity work. Use `$harnessloop-connectivity` to run declared connectivity checks. Do not fold inventory or connectivity probing into evidence mutation unless the user explicitly asks and all required conditions are declared. If connectivity is failed, blocked, skipped, or needs user confirmation, ask the user for the missing access facts before changing evidence health or recommending continuation.
harnessloop/plugins/harnessloop/skills/harnessloop-evidence/SKILL.md:45:1. Read `.harnessloop/state/evidence-index.md`, the active goal's `data-contract.md`, and the active round `scope-lock.md` or `decision.md` when present.
harnessloop/plugins/harnessloop/skills/harnessloop-evidence/SKILL.md:54:If evidence shows a runtime blocker that prevents the original trigger/action but leaves a safe read-only investigation path, classify it as `runtime-recoverable` and return `recovery-eligible: yes`. If the next step would mutate external state, clean up rows, trigger a job, roll back, or make a business decision, classify it as `write-safety-required` or `human-decision-required` and ask for the missing confirmation instead.
harnessloop/plugins/harnessloop/skills/harnessloop-evidence/SKILL.md:56:When an external system read or write is involved, first verify that the request states the system, operation, required parameters, permission scope, credential reference, and failure handling. If any of these are missing or ambiguous, stop before tool use and ask the user a focused question for the missing condition.
harnessloop/plugins/harnessloop/skills/harnessloop-evidence/SKILL.md:82:- external system:
harnessloop/plugins/harnessloop/skills/harnessloop-evidence/SKILL.md:106:- Do not infer external-system access details. Missing endpoint, account, credential reference, permission, required parameter, write target, or access verification method must be resolved by asking the user before attempting access.
harnessloop/plugins/harnessloop/skills/harnessloop-delegation/SKILL.md:18:- `delegation-mechanism`: Codex subagent, Claude Code swarm, Claude Code subagent, external worker, manual handoff, or unknown.
harnessloop/plugins/harnessloop/skills/harnessloop-delegation/SKILL.md:29:1. Read `.harnessloop/setup/cost-context-policy.md`, `.harnessloop/state/environment.md`, `.harnessloop/state/self-check.md`, `.harnessloop/meta/self-audit.md`, current state, active round handoffs, and the requested handoff path when present.
harnessloop/plugins/harnessloop/skills/harnessloop-delegation/SKILL.md:35:7. For high-risk, cross-cutting, write-capable, or external-system delegation, require verified mechanism, scope boundaries, output path, evidence citation behavior, and expected versus observed model/effort.
harnessloop/plugins/harnessloop/skills/harnessloop-delegation/SKILL.md:36:8. Write or recommend updates to `.harnessloop/state/environment.md`, `.harnessloop/state/self-check.md`, active handoff closeout, or `.harnessloop/meta/self-audit.md` when the check changes delegation health.
harnessloop/plugins/harnessloop/skills/harnessloop-delegation/SKILL.md:77:- Do not delegate final goal interpretation, goal breakdown approval, scope-lock changes, human-required decisions, or round acceptance.
harnessloop/plugins/harnessloop/skills/harnessloop-delegation/SKILL.md:78:- Do not perform external-system access checks from this skill; route channel inventory to `$harnessloop-channels` and connectivity checks to `$harnessloop-connectivity`.
harnessloop/plugins/harnessloop/skills/harnessloop-status/SKILL.md:29:4. Summarize evidence health without revalidating external systems unless the user explicitly asks for evidence checking; route that to `$harnessloop-evidence`.
harnessloop/plugins/harnessloop/skills/harnessloop-status/SKILL.md:73:- Running `check_setup.py` with `-B`/`PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1` satisfies the read-only mandate above: it performs no writes (including bytecode cache), no external probing, and no continuation decision.
harnessloop/plugins/harnessloop/skills/harnessloop-continue/SKILL.md:19:- Optional evidence, tool, or external-system confirmation needed by the current control gate.
harnessloop/plugins/harnessloop/skills/harnessloop-continue/SKILL.md:28:1. Run `python3 -B <plugin-root>/skills/harnessloop-loop/scripts/check_setup.py --project <target-project> --json`. If `gate_blocking` is `true`, set decision to `needs-setup`, name the `template`/`missing` core file (environment.md, control-contract.md, or cost-context-policy.md) as the next setup step, and stop before evaluating any other gate. Do not execute business work. If `gate_blocking` is `false` but `complete` is `false`, do not stop; record `setup gate: warning`, `field_todo_count`, `selfcheck_todo_count`, and the `missing_sections` of any non-`filled` file, then proceed to step 2.
harnessloop/plugins/harnessloop/skills/harnessloop-continue/SKILL.md:29:2. Read `.harnessloop/state/current.md`, `state/control-contract.md`, `state/environment.md`, `state/evidence-index.md`, `state/self-check.md`, `meta/self-audit.md`, the active goal, active round, open handoffs, and latest decision.
harnessloop/plugins/harnessloop/skills/harnessloop-continue/SKILL.md:34:7. If feedback is `blocked`, classify the blocker before stopping. Use `runtime-recoverable`, `access-missing`, `write-safety-required`, `human-decision-required`, `contract-insufficient`, `external-system-unsafe`, or `unknown`.
harnessloop/plugins/harnessloop/skills/harnessloop-continue/SKILL.md:36:9. If the blocker requires write cleanup, external mutation, missing access facts, missing local channel parameters, a named tool that is unavailable, or business judgment, stop and ask the user through `askuserquestion` when available.
harnessloop/plugins/harnessloop/skills/harnessloop-continue/SKILL.md:39:12. If self-audit, environment, delegation, named-tool, external-system, or access requirements are missing or ambiguous, ask the user for confirmation before tool use or execution. Use `askuserquestion` when available; otherwise ask directly in chat.
harnessloop/plugins/harnessloop/skills/harnessloop-continue/SKILL.md:49:- `external-system-unsafe`: an external system is in a state where probing or mutation could duplicate work, corrupt state, or hide evidence.
harnessloop/plugins/harnessloop/skills/harnessloop-continue/SKILL.md:92:- Do not bypass human-confirm states, missing evidence, failed intake, failed self-audit, unavailable named tools, ambiguous external-system parameters, or unsafe writes.
harnessloop/plugins/harnessloop/skills/harnessloop-continue/SKILL.md:93:- Do not perform cleanup, trigger, rollback, or other external writes from a runtime-recovery round without explicit write-safety details and human confirmation when required.
harnessloop/plugins/harnessloop/skills/harnessloop-continue/SKILL.md:95:- Do not infer named-tool substitutions or external-system access details; ask the user first.
harnessloop/plugins/harnessloop/skills/harnessloop-channels/agents/openai.yaml:3:  short_description: "List external systems and tools"
harnessloop/plugins/harnessloop/skills/harnessloop-channels/agents/openai.yaml:4:  default_prompt: "Use $harnessloop-channels when the user says harnessloop:channels to list external systems, channels, and tools."
harnessloop/plugins/harnessloop/skills/harnessloop-loop/SKILL.md:3:description: "Use when running or taking over a long-running goal-driven task in an installed project: create or import Harnessloop state, run intake gates for existing agent sessions, decompose goals, define evidence and validation contracts, enforce scope-locks, manage file-system handoffs, verify with real static/dynamic/runtime/source evidence, classify feedback, self-audit for drift or dead loops, and continue only through evidence-backed control gates."
harnessloop/plugins/harnessloop/skills/harnessloop-loop/SKILL.md:20:The useful input should include goal/non-goal context, acceptance criteria, relevant file paths, available validation commands, external tool requirements, and any required human decisions. If these are missing, create the smallest setup, status, or gap request instead of inventing facts.
harnessloop/plugins/harnessloop/skills/harnessloop-loop/SKILL.md:31:4. Execute business work only after scope-lock, evidence contract, and continuation rules allow it.
harnessloop/plugins/harnessloop/skills/harnessloop-loop/SKILL.md:36:Produce file-backed loop state, not just chat summaries. Depending on the request, write or update goal files, thresholds, data contracts, scope-locks, handoffs, evidence, reviews, decisions, state indexes, or evolution issues. End with a concise status summary that names changed files, evidence used, feedback class if known, and the next allowed action or blocking human decision.
harnessloop/plugins/harnessloop/skills/harnessloop-loop/SKILL.md:40:For control-plane state, evidence indexing, environment self-check, and evals, use the matching templates in `references/`. For control-contract profile presets (lite/standard/strict), see `references/control-contract-profiles.md`.
