./kernels/openclaw/CHANGELOG.md:130:- **Discord thread archive defaults:** inherit each parent channel's configured auto-archive duration for binding-created threads instead of forcing 60 minutes, while preserving explicit overrides. (#103413) Thanks @wings1029.
./kernels/openclaw/CHANGELOG.md:147:- **Plain-text XML tool calls:** repair zero-argument calls and keep byte/character-bounded stream normalization from leaking incomplete or oversized tool syntax while preserving visible suffix text. (#98984, #102240, #102933, #102975, #103220, #103585) Thanks @wangyan2026, @qingminglong, @wuqxuan, and @ZOOWH.
./kernels/openclaw/CHANGELOG.md:178:- **Unicode-safe bounded text:** preserve complete UTF-16 surrogate pairs when shortening previews, prompts, diagnostics, labels, session keys, link metadata, and identity values across Control UI, CLI, Gateway, plugins, QA, memory, and Android surfaces. (#102625, #102626, #102627, #102656, #102816, #102823, #102833, #102877, #102949, #102963, #102969, #102988, #103010, #103034, #103210, #103341, #103487, #103543, #103580, #103646) Thanks @zhangguiping-xydt, @wings1029, @wangyan2026, @Pandah97, @MoerAI, @SunnyShu0925, @zhangqueping, @zw-xysk, @cxbAsDev, @lzyyzznl, @coder-master-0915, @LeonidasLux, @mushuiyu886, @ly85206559, @Simon-XYDT, and @lsr911.
./kernels/openclaw/CHANGELOG.md:835:- An oversized Discord gateway metadata response now logs a bounded error and falls back to Discord's default gateway URL instead of risking a Gateway crash. [#98682](https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/pull/98682) Thanks @wings1029.
./kernels/openclaw/CHANGELOG.md:898:- Stalled Feishu tenant-token or streaming-card requests now time out with a clear error and release the processing lane so other Gateway messages can continue. [#102948](https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/pull/102948) Thanks @hugenshen, @sallyom.
./kernels/openclaw/CHANGELOG.md:1294:- MiniMax VLM and native PDF provider errors now remain readable when emoji or other supplementary characters land at the diagnostic snippet limit. [#101728](https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/pull/101728) Thanks @wings1029.
./kernels/openclaw/CHANGELOG.md:1724:- Long names, labels, summaries, previews, titles, and diagnostics across OpenClaw now truncate without splitting emoji or other supplementary Unicode characters. [#101685](https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/pull/101685) Thanks @lsr911, @ly85206559, @maweibin, @wings1029.
./kernels/openclaw/CHANGELOG.md:2385:- Trimmed OpenClaw CLI logs now remain valid UTF-8 when the retained byte range begins inside an emoji or other multibyte character. [#101029](https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/pull/101029) Thanks @ly85206559.
./kernels/openclaw/CHANGELOG.md:2549:- Oversized browser-control error responses can no longer consume excessive Gateway memory, while ordinary failures still provide useful diagnostics. [#98455](https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/pull/98455) Thanks @wings1029.
./kernels/openclaw/CHANGELOG.md:2612:- Broken child-process output, timeouts, and aborts during agent shell commands are now contained instead of causing rare Gateway crashes. [#101370](https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/pull/101370) Thanks @wings1029.
./kernels/openclaw/CHANGELOG.md:2650:- QMD command pipe failures now report a clean memory-operation error instead of taking down the memory host. [#101402](https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/pull/101402) Thanks @wings1029.
./kernels/openclaw/CHANGELOG.md:13717:- Telegram/voice mention gating: add optional `disableAudioPreflight` on group/topic config to skip mention-detection preflight transcription for inbound voice notes where operators want text-only mention checks. (#23067) Thanks @yangnim21029.
./kernels/openclaw/CHANGELOG.md:15653:- Hooks: replace loader `console.*` output with subsystem logger messages so hook loading errors/warnings route through standard logging. (#11029) Thanks @shadril238.
